{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06","cat":"favorite","group":{"id":"fav5014","label":"Julia"},"label":"The Premiere","stage":null,"prev":"treasurestory_julia_05","next":null,"speakers":{"julia":"Julia"},"icons":{"julia":"si_c150_00_s"},"notes":["Favorite item quest step: Go to the Theater"],"lines":[{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_1","text":"A few days later,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Theater","bgArt":"theater","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_2","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_2","text":"Julia invites me to the theater.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_3","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_3","text":"Inside the empty theater, without any other audience members or staff,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_4","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_4","text":"Julia stands alone on the stage, preparing to perform.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["julia"],"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_5","text":"Hello, Julia.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_6","text":"Conductor! You came.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_frostpillar","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_7","text":"Thank you for accepting my invitation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_8","text":"I take it you've finished the piece?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_9","text":"I've composed an immensely satisfying end to it, thanks to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_10","text":"The harmonious intermingling of both my soul and yours.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_11","text":"Together, they create a piece that can stand proudly alongside those songs from the surface and those notes of the past.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_12","text":"But even after pouring everything I have into this piece, it still feels as if I've merely caught a fleeting glimpse of their distant silhouettes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_13","text":"It makes me a little worried about what lies ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_14","text":"You shouldn't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_15","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_16","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_16","text":"If you're the Julia I know, you'll do just fine.","jump":"treasurestory_julia_06_18","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_17","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_17","text":"I'll stay by your side and support you.","jump":"treasurestory_julia_06_18","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_18","text":"... It's fascinating.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_19","text":"Simply hearing you say that","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_20","text":"makes all of my worries dissipate, as if they were a mirage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_21","text":"You're right. There is no need to worry.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_22","text":"I simply need to walk the path those before me took, even if I do it slowly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_23","text":"Well then, let us take the first step together, you and I, connected through music.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_24","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_24","text":"Julia places the notebook on the music stand on the stage","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_25","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_25","text":"and adjusts her posture in preparation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_26","text":"This is a piece which I composed while thinking of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_27","text":"I'm honored for you to be the first to hear it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_28","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_28","text":"Julia's performance begins.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_29","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_29","text":"♬♪♩♬♪♩♬♪♩","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_girls","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_30","text":"The violin produces a melody which resonates throughout the theater,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_31","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_31","text":"transforming and fluctuating between differing and dynamic emotional shifts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_32","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_32","text":"At times, it is an ode to a steadfast guardian.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_33","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_33","text":"In others, a hymn celebrating joy shared with others.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_34","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_34","text":"Occasionally, it's even a love song about spending precious days with someone you cherish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_35","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_35","text":"Julia fills the empty theater with her sound,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_36","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_36","text":"pouring her soul into every note.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_37","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_37","text":"*Clap clap clap clap*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_38","text":"Thank you for listening, Conductor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_cosmos","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_39","text":"Bravo. It was a magnificent performance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_40","text":"It brought back so many memories of the day we spent together.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_41","text":"I'm glad!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_42","text":"I knew you would be receptive to it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_43","text":"It is as you said.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_44","text":"At first, I intended to compose a piece solely about you,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_45","text":"but after spending the day together, I couldn't help but desire more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_46","text":"I wanted to insert myself within the melody along with you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_47","text":"Then I'd say the song conveyed that feeling perfectly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_48","text":"... I'm so relieved to have completed my notebook, and to have done it with a melody of my own invention.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_49","text":"Through this song, I feel connected to you, Conductor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_50","text":"Therefore, I would like to give you the original copy of this completed notebook.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_51","text":"As proof that my story has reached you,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_52","text":"and that we are now connected.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_53","text":"I'll treasure it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_54","text":"I vowed to dedicate my life to music.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_55","text":"But when it comes to you, Conductor...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_56","text":"I would gladly give half my life to you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_57","text":"... Perhaps even more than that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_58","text":"But such a thing would be like attempting to lasso the clouds. An impossible wish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_59","text":"So I will be content with giving you this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_60","text":"If you remember me through this notebook, whose pages contain my story, my very soul,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_julia_06_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"julia","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_julia_06_61","text":"then I will always be by your side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}